nel state, and post-restart printing were verified. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The generic failed-services lifecycle probe is unsupported on Alpine; direct OpenRC service-status and CUPS scheduler checks compensate for this evidence gap.","The evidence can establish exactly-once processing within the captured baseline and executor timeline, but cannot rule out activity outside the captured interval."]}
